SUMMARY:The Warped Band - The Ultimate Tribute to The Warped Tour
DESCRIPTION:Saturday June 20th\, 2026\nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $22.40 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nThe Warped Band is the official tribute that resurrects the spirit of the legendary Warped Tour\, honoring the festival that brought us unforgettable summers filled with music.  \nThe band is the only tribute endorsed by Kevin Lyman (Founder/Owner of Warped Tour) and Warped Tour itself. As the Official Tribute\, We cover all the genres that made the Warped Tour iconic—from pop punk and emo to ska\, hardcore\, metalcore\, and skate punk. As the only nationally recognized tribute to the Warped Tour\, we’re dedicated to keeping the energy\, nostalgia\, and music alive for fans everywhere. Fans can vote on over 150 songs to shape the setlist for each show\, ensuring every night is unique.  \nJoin us for the best night ever\, where we relive the energy\, music\, and memories with a setlist featuring classics from Blink-182\, Papa Roach\, Good Charlotte\, Green Day\, Goldfinger\, NOFX\, 3Oh!3\, Avril Lavigne\, Linkin Park\, Pierce The Veil and many more! \nCheck out The Warped Band here!\nWebsite | Instagram | Facebook \nSupported by: Blind Accuracy\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
